# Backend environment template (Emergent)

Copy these into the Emergent web UI → backend `.env` (never commit real secrets).
Restart backend after changes: `sudo supervisorctl restart backend`.

## Required — app boots

```
MONGO_URL=mongodb://...
DB_NAME=test_database
EMERGENT_LLM_KEY=...
```

## Required — production sale

```
PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=https://heirloomunbound.com
PUBLIC_FRONTEND_URL=https://heirloomunbound.com
CORS_ORIGINS=https://heirloomunbound.com
REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=https://heirloomunbound.com

STRIPE_API_KEY=sk_live_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
STRIPE_PAYMENT_LINK_URL=https://buy.stripe.com/...
STRIPE_PAYMENT_LINK_ID=plink_...

RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
SENDER_EMAIL=noreply@your-verified-domain.com
SENDER_NAME=Heirloom

# Gate product APIs + app shell to lifetime buyers (leave unset on preview)
ENFORCE_PURCHASE=true
```

## Optional integrations (BYO or platform)

```
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
D_ID_API_KEY=
FAL_KEY=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
SENTRY_DSN=
SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=production
SENTRY_DEBUG_SECRET=
PHOTO_SIGN_SECRET=
APP_STORAGE_PREFIX=heirloom
```

## Preview tip

On Emergent preview, leave `ENFORCE_PURCHASE` unset so Google login stays open for demos.
Use `/test` in the browser for free tester mode (hides Buy CTAs only).
